"\t* Made the code compatible with reorganized braille support subsystem implemented in NVDA 2026.3.\n"
"\t* Dropped border color and style settings from document presentation settings.\n"
"\t* Added a setting to mute NVDA sounds when spech is muted."
msgstr ""

